2. Academic Manuscript and Documentation
----------------------------------------
All academic paper text, LaTeX sources, figures, and documentation in `docs/` and `README.md`
are licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0) License:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

3. Derived Benchmark Manifests & Feature Representations
--------------------------------------------------------
The split manifests (`data/splits_manifest/`), cached embeddings (`cache/features/`),
and benchmark evaluation tables (`outputs/`) are derived from the upstream research corpora:
- CrisisMMD (Alam et al., ICWSM 2018), released under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0.
- HumAID (Alam et al., ICWSM 2021), released by QCRI under Non-Commercial Research Use terms.

In accordance with upstream license terms, all derived split manifests, feature caches,
and evaluation results are distributed strictly under Creative Commons
Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/
